{
  "title": "Who Is Hiring in the DRC, and What Is Still Missing?",
  "summary": "A shortage of advertisements in one database is not proof that a profession is absent. The DRC vacancy sample identifies recruitment in telecommunications operations, cyber governance, software, monitoring, master data and electrical engineering. The question is whether these occupations have depth, continuity and accessible career pathways.",
